  "intro": {
    "zh": "这是一份<b>模拟数据</b>，用来演示三条新规则：核心小镇外最多推荐 <b>7 个周边村镇</b>（按交通便利排序）、单个村镇住宿结果多时最多列 <b>7 家</b>、komoot 徒步路线最多 <b>7 条</b>（优先热门知名、风景好的）；同时演示改成纯 SVG 代码画图后的「住宿地图」「户外运动地图」「komoot 路线地图」，不再依赖 Leaflet 等外部地图库，离线也能看。所有数字、价格、评分、坐标均为虚构，不代表真实查询结果。",
    "en": "This is <b>mock data</b> demonstrating three rules: at most <b>7 nearby villages</b> beyond the main town (ranked by transit convenience), at most <b>7 stays</b> listed when one village has many results, and at most <b>7 komoot hikes</b> (favouring popular, well-known, scenic routes). It also shows the \"stays map\", \"outdoor sports map\" and \"komoot hikes map\" now drawn in plain SVG code, with no Leaflet or other external map library, so they work offline. All numbers, prices, ratings and coordinates are made up."
  },
